01-75e9-4422-8a80-77f7b27ec45d","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"ほんとかな?","ts":"1621593347.027200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"BTgp0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"924f4013-f3c9-41ed-bb01-bc2258fde2c7","type":"message","user":"UERCTTT8B","text":"パフォーマンスが必須要件に入らないというのが気になった","ts":"1621593345.026900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Cau/c"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UTMDDL5B9","text":"\u003c@UTMDDL5B9\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621593262.026500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"6c974027-25d6-4622-9ff7-64cf6be50ec0","type":"message","user":"UL6CFN8NR","text":"tar sea か に","ts":"1621593037.026100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"dajare","count":4,"users":["UG6DF6W87","U9S4G0LJW","U8CC7MDCL","U01ATUT6PL3"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"790JI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"dff97448-3da4-4ec1-94fb-e55b9039e0cd","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"と思った","ts":"1621592988.025900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"XotF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"cd7e7681-60ff-4fe8-b9ec-b50376f37c89","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"問題は実世界(Out of the tar pitの外)が複雑でtar seaになってるってことかもしれんなあ","ts":"1621592984.025700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OIa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"578cd645-5bc8-4ca0-a4fe-ceb8859a0b6e","type":"message","user":"UG6DF6W87","text":"付随的と言ってる部分の分類にも興味がある...","ts":"1621592974.025400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"63SZB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"96883f98-ba34-4a45-9f68-86fd1aa2303a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"「計算時間が無の理想のマシンを想定する」のところもよかった\nアーキテクチャを考えるときってノイズが多いのでこの考え方大事ですね、参考になった","ts":"1621592848.023800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hHEdx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"97c94340-2423-4b17-93da-1411a888e8b5","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"あ、この記事の一番いいところは本当に抽象的に論じてるところですね\nwebアプリに閉じてない","ts":"1621592788.023100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NhLG"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2b90efb7-5705-4c6b-8644-25839e76037c","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"最近どっかの焼きまわしみたいな資料が多かったけどこれはオリジナリティあって好きな記事でした","ts":"1621592765.022600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UKHUVMBJR"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"891l"}]},{"client_msg_id":"98c31699-337c-4b33-83d5-9497be862cf8","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"でも残念だけど必須と付随って明確に区別できないよなーと思った","ts":"1621592711.021800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"i75"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9962976e-f895-43f8-ba30-e6c9892e356a","type":"message","user":"UKHUVMBJR","text":"coding案件\nいいこといってるなーと思った（こなみかん）\n\u003chttps://tech.uzabase.com/entry/2021/05/20/141950\u003e","ts":"1621592681.021100","attachments":[{"fallback":"Uzabase Tech: システムの複雑さはどこから来るのか – Out of the tar pitを読む - Uzabase Tech","id":1,"title":"システムの複雑さはどこから来るのか – Out of the tar pitを読む - Uzabase Tech","title_link":"https://tech.uzabase.com/entry/2021/05/20/141950","text":"Uzabase Saas Product Divisionフェローの矢野です。 この記事は、Rich Hickey（プログラミング言語Clojure作者）のプレゼンテーションSimple Made Easyへと繋がっていく、Ben MoseleyとPeter Marksによる「Out of the tar pit」というシステム設計について論じた論文の内容について説明したもので、ユーザベースのSaas Productでのテック発表の一つとしてプレゼンしたものを、ブログとして再度まとめたものです。プレゼン自体は25分くらいでしたので、おそらくこの記事の方がプレゼンよりも詳しいと思います。 ソフト…","image_url":"https://cdn-ak.f.st-hatena.com/images/fotolife/t/t_yano/20210512/20210512190545.png","blocks":null,"ts":1621487990,"service_name":"Uzabase Tech","service_icon":"https://tech.uzabase.com/icon/touch","from_url":"https://tech.uzabase.com/entry/2021/05/20/141950","original_url":"https://tech.uzabase.com/entry/2021/05/20/141950"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"OETo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"F3909042-9891-4307-9FB1-E5971AAB8805","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"技術系のPodcast、どれも面白いけど数多すぎて追い切れない","ts":"1621591882.020400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["U7B4ZD49X"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qsLc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"CD34EA59-5A3B-46DD-A654-AC5B3E92A4D0","type":"message","user":"U011FTGJ3SN","text":"\u003chttp://fukabori.fm|fukabori.fm\u003eのt_wadaさん回はどれもおもろいですよねー","ts":"1621591832.019700","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6unT"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U8CC7MDCL","text":"\u003c@U8CC7MDCL\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621589224.018800","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"e97967fd-1c65-450d-9660-76eb7d86da92","type":"message","user":"U7B4ZD49X","text":"DIとからへんもJavaJavaしてますよね・・・t-wadaさんがJava民だから仕方ないけど。\nなんというかこういうプログラミング設計論を抽象化して伝えすぎるとわからなくなるし（実際さわってみたらすぐわかる）、逆にプログラミング言語固有に寄り過ぎると伝えたいことが伝わらなかったり\nむずかしい","ts":"1621587696.018600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"noQ"}]},{"type":"message","user":"U022M162A4A","text":"\u003c@U022M162A4A\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621587564.016700","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"415f2e35-53fd-4a8b-a85b-11a58c2fbbf7","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"DIコンテナにも種類があるから、特定してはったな。わすれてしまった。","ts":"1621587318.016500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8HvLq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"35b1b821-a0c7-444d-b857-ac627354d0d9","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"new するときに、なぜかそこにいるやつを共通で作りたい。ってのがDI コンテナだと理解しました。","ts":"1621587250.015800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Xcjg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"6ced6f27-6e16-4ca3-9cf0-f99d5b5f4016","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"生成ルールを各クラスのコンストラクタの引数で渡すようになった結果、mainが具体クラスばっかりになって汚くなるところまでは分かったんですが、、","ts":"1621587011.014600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8Aep"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adc6e248-08cd-4439-bce0-b9ae37f1fa88","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"DIコンテナ、やっぱり話だけだと良く分からなかったので調べたい。\nとりあえず厄介事を押しつけられたかわいそうな奴と理解しました。","ts":"1621586955.014400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"326"}]},{"client_msg_id":"89a59eea-f93c-4533-a89a-4f0e961f9647","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"まあそうですね、そして知ってると最初から意思疎通や構造によるリファクタリングの筋道が見えやすいので、無駄やらが多少減る","ts":"1621586445.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"jpgDA"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0A71DA14-439E-458A-8291-F8E8E703C07E","type":"message","user":"U01PMN2BVJQ","text":"Kiss、yagni、dryは覚えてるけど、抽象度は揃えろって奴とあともう一つを毎回忘れてしまう。","ts":"1621586425.013800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"k1XZ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc6a4a6d-29c0-47a7-a9f2-ebd9e05312c3","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"なんかしらんけど、うまいことかけたら、Design pattern ちゅうやつやった。っていう定義もあるんで、ごっつう似せなくてもいいんじゃない。って気分がかるくなったよ。\u0026gt; podcast","ts":"1621586234.011800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"desune","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mf+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"86aba4ee-a0db-4822-ac84-dadb1055f73d","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"YAGNIの話も出てきました。将来は予見できないので、予測せずに常に最適なコードにしておく。\n\u003chttps://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/YAGNI\u003e","ts":"1621586213.011200","attachments":[{"fallback":"wikipedia: YAGNI","id":1,"author_name":"Wikipedia","author_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/","title":"YAGNI","title_link":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/YAGNI","text":"\"You ain't gonna need it\"、縮めて YAGNI とは、機能は実際に必要となるまでは追加しないのがよいとする、エクストリーム・プログラミングにおける原則である。","blocks":null,"service_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/unfurl_icons/wikipedia.png","from_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/YAGNI","original_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/YAGNI"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lhS4J"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d813e18b-6edb-4474-892a-624b9148c930","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"デザインパターンを知ってその通りに作るというか、常に最速最適なコーディングをして、ある程度大きくなったらリファクタリングする話と理解しました。\nどうやってリファクタリングしたらいいかをデザインパターンが教えてくれるという方向。","ts":"1621586159.010200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"6tf"}]},{"client_msg_id":"adc2c83f-79ce-4644-abc7-0dd1cde3d096","type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"このチャンネル知らんかったー","ts":"1621586050.009800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"youkoso","count":1,"users":["UDPT2BZ6E"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"cVJN"}]},{"type":"message","user":"UDDCM376D","text":"\u003c@UDDCM376D\u003e has joined the channel","ts":"1621586044.009500","subtype":"channel_join","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"9f2d9d95-714b-4e91-995c-5e8ab33cb8f5","type":"message","user":"UDPT2BZ6E","text":"です